.TH METARM 1 2021-09-19 GNU

.SH NAME
metarm \- meta remove

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B metarm
[\fB\-h\fR]
[\fB\-v\fR]
[\fB\-f\fR \fIfile\fR]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B metarm
metadata removal tool

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
displays help page
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
prints version information
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-file " " \fIfile
file you want to remove metadata from

.SH FILES
.TP
.I /proc/metarm

.SH AUTHOR
Kris Huber <kris@krishuber.xyz>

.SH SEE ALSO
\fBrustc\fR(1)
